  "id": "bubble-bay",
  "title": "Bubble Bay",
  "tagline": "Aim the launcher, match three, keep the wall off the line.",
  "description": "Drag anywhere to aim the launcher and release to fire. Every bubble sticks where it lands, so three of a colour in a row pops and the bubbles above them fall away. If you miss the wall it grows a new row: eight shots per row at the start, fewer as the rounds go up, and the danger line creeps closer. A round ends when the wall is empty; a run ends when a bubble crosses the line. Score and best score stay on the device.",
